  "conclusion": "corresponds",
  "rationale": "readPath distinguishes failed lookup from an existing empty final slot and only follows occupied intermediates. Satisfies requires a matching root class, allocated correctly typed targets at all positive paths, and empty negative paths. Realizes combines class/environment/pending admissibility, WellFormedWith pending roots, FieldsMatchClasses even on hidden fields, exact variable domain and slot agreement, and satisfaction of pending entries. This matches the four listed conditions and avoids requiring all allocated objects to be whole. Earlier state/observation/environment units introduce every relation used.",
